       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DLYTRP01.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY E: BATCH / FILE PROCESSING - DAILY TRANSACTION REPORT
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT TX-IN-FILE ASSIGN TO 'TRANS.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-TX-STATUS.
           SELECT RPT-OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO 'TXRPT.TXT'
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-RPT-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  TX-IN-FILE.
       01  FD-TX-IN-RECORD.
           05  FD-TX-ID            PIC X(12).
           05  FD-TX-CODE          PIC X(3).
           05  FD-TX-VAL           PIC 9(7)V99.
           05  FD-TX-SUSPICIOUS    PIC X(1).
       FD  RPT-OUT-FILE.
       01  FD-RPT-LINE             PIC X(80).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TX-STATUS            PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
       01  WS-RPT-STATUS           PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
       01  WS-EOF                  PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-AUDIT-SUMMARY.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TX-COUNT   PIC 9(5) VALUE 00000.
           05  WS-HIGH-RISK-COUNT  PIC 9(4) VALUE 0000.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SETTLED    PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 00000000.00.
       01  WS-FORMATTED-LINE       PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-GENERATE-REPORT.
           PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE-FILES
           PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-RECORDS UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
           PERFORM 3000-FINALIZE-FILES
           GOBACK.

       1000-INITIALIZE-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT TX-IN-FILE
           OPEN OUTPUT RPT-OUT-FILE
           READ TX-IN-FILE INTO FD-TX-IN-RECORD
               AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
           END-READ.

       2000-PROCESS-RECORDS.
           PERFORM 2100-CLASSIFY-TRANSACTION
           READ TX-IN-FILE INTO FD-TX-IN-RECORD
               AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
           END-READ.

       2100-CLASSIFY-TRANSACTION.
           ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TX-COUNT
           IF FD-TX-VAL > 10000.00 OR FD-TX-SUSPICIOUS = 'Y'
               ADD 1 TO WS-HIGH-RISK-COUNT
               MOVE 'HIGH RISK TRANSACTION FLAGGED' TO WS-FORMATTED-LINE
           ELSE
               COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-SETTLED = WS-TOTAL-SETTLED + FD-TX-VAL
               MOVE 'STANDARD TRANSACTION SETTLED' TO WS-FORMATTED-LINE
           END-IF
           WRITE FD-RPT-LINE FROM WS-FORMATTED-LINE.

       3000-FINALIZE-FILES.
           CLOSE TX-IN-FILE
           CLOSE RPT-OUT-FILE.
